  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WB Handelsproc facilitet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WB Trade Faci Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The World Bank has together w/ i.a. Sida initiated cooperation in the area of trade facilitation through the Trade Facilitation Facility    (TFF), financed by a multi-donor trust fund. The TFF will finance     activities at country and regional levels that are intended to make   immediate, direct, and effective improvements in developing           countries&apos; trade facilitation systems.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">V&#xe4;rldsbanken har tillsammans med bl.a. Sida skapat ett samarbete p&#xe5;   omr&#xe5;det f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;renkling av handelsprocedurer genom Trade Facilitation  Facility (TFF), som finansieras av fond av flera givare. TFF kommer   att finansiera aktiviteter p&#xe5; landsniv&#xe5; och regional niv&#xe5; som syftar  till att g&#xf6;ra omedelbar, direkt, och effektiva f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar i        utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder system underl&#xe4;tta handeln.</narrative>
  </description>
